<h1>United MileagePlus Miles Value Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Estimate the travel purchasing power of your United MileagePlus miles. Choose an illustrative valuation benchmark or input a custom cents-per-mile assumption to evaluate your mileage portfolio.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  United MileagePlus miles do not possess a fixed cash value because United utilizes dynamic award pricing without fixed award charts. For general planning, travelers commonly model United miles between 1.0¢ and 1.5¢ each. To estimate your portfolio's travel purchasing power, multiply your mileage balance by your estimated cents-per-mile assumption and divide by 100.
</div>

<div class="currency-selector" style="margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: right;">
